{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 9214636295446709731,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Merge Conflicts",
      "source_hash": 6562203508359531582,
      "context_hash": 4113483296906224767,
      "translation": "병합 충돌",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981636Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The `merge-conflicts` feature detects if a Pull Request has a merge conflict, and will post a comment asking the author to resolve the conflicts.",
      "source_hash": 14232866967381465148,
      "context_hash": 8733186893946571172,
      "translation": "`merge-conflicts` 기능은 풀 리퀘스트에 병합 충돌이 있는지 감지하며, 작성자에게 충돌 해결을 요청하는 댓글을 작성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981637Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 17353453080143477577,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981637Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This is triggered automatically when a commit is made to a branch that causes existing, open PRs to have a merge conflict.",
      "source_hash": 15659976091195601053,
      "context_hash": 5704659937279978909,
      "translation": "이는 기존에 열려 있는 PR에 병합 충돌을 일으키는 커밋이 브랜치에 만들어질 때 자동으로 트리거됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981637Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The bot will post a comment to the PR that roughly looks like this:",
      "source_hash": 9832647277975826932,
      "context_hash": 8162043390068902696,
      "translation": "봇은 대략 다음과 같은 댓글을 PR에 작성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981637Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "☔ The latest upstream changes (possibly #152) made this pull request unmergeable.",
      "source_hash": 14162254367615755291,
      "context_hash": 5869722743511100938,
      "translation": "☔ 최신 업스트림 변경 사항(아마도 #152)으로 인해 이 풀 리퀘스트를 병합할 수 없게 되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981637Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Please [resolve the merge conflicts](https://rustc-dev-guide.rust-lang.org/git.html#rebasing-and-conflicts).",
      "source_hash": 14986420118868831402,
      "context_hash": 18119792388820273218,
      "translation": "[병합 충돌을 해결](https://rustc-dev-guide.rust-lang.org/git.html#rebasing-and-conflicts)해 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Note that it may take a minute or so for the comments to be posted.",
      "source_hash": 6824579449345981894,
      "context_hash": 12245873505148250537,
      "translation": "댓글이 게시되기까지 1분 정도 걸릴 수 있다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 1964352047739510026,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "[!NOTE] This feature is [enabled by default](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml) in the rust-lang organization, except when using bors which has its own notifications.",
      "source_hash": 18090812009211712861,
      "context_hash": 8919559838389693432,
      "translation": "참고: 이 기능은 rust-lang 조직에서 [기본적으로 활성화](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml)되어 있으나, 자체 알림 기능을 가진 bors를 사용하는 경우는 예외입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bors": "bors",
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:29.197505Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a `[merge-conflicts]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 6936429669082883742,
      "context_hash": 1249252713045545407,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[merge-conflicts]` 테이블을 두면 저장소에서 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "There are several optional keys that you can include:",
      "source_hash": 8064559743811959887,
      "context_hash": 15734333888484255446,
      "translation": "포함할 수 있는 선택적 키 몇 가지는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`consider-prs-from-bots` --- Should merge conflicts be reported for PR opened by bots.",
      "source_hash": 18432611586715630489,
      "context_hash": 13157533199188550282,
      "translation": "`consider-prs-from-bots` --- 봇이 연 PR에 대해서도 병합 충돌을 보고할지 여부입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`remove` --- A list of labels to remove from the PR when a conflict is detected.",
      "source_hash": 15960943113114992441,
      "context_hash": 16677572590087312309,
      "translation": "`remove` --- 충돌이 감지되었을 때 PR에서 제거할 라벨 목록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981638Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`add` --- A list of labels to add to the PR when a conflict is detected.",
      "source_hash": 3803452938697727945,
      "context_hash": 9332426335929408590,
      "translation": "`add` --- 충돌이 감지되었을 때 PR에 추가할 라벨 목록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`unless` --- A list of labels that, if already present on the PR, will prevent triagebot from adding or removing labels.",
      "source_hash": 13164677009682899517,
      "context_hash": 3379644324171450671,
      "translation": "`unless` --- PR에 이미 존재하는 경우 triagebot이 레이블을 추가하거나 제거하지 못하도록 막는 레이블 목록입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:29.197506Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Example",
      "source_hash": 1513857641461741027,
      "context_hash": 17189325482603952622,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 6262958539432958287,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:37.981639Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/merge_conflicts.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/merge_conflicts.rs).",
      "source_hash": 2617350499732513978,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/merge_conflicts.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/merge_conflicts.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
